5. DEVELOPER FEE
   The Software contains a built-in developer fee. The fee rate depends on the
   algorithm being mined and is displayed when the Software starts (for example,
   "Dev fee 2.00% enabled"); it is applied transparently while mining. You may not
   cancel, reduce, change, remove, block, redirect, or otherwise interfere with the
   developer fee by any means.

6. DATA AND PRIVACY
   The Software does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data, and contains
   no telemetry, analytics, or update-checking. Its only outbound network connections
   are to the mining pool you configure and, during the developer-fee interval, to
   the developer's pool. The optional local monitoring API, when enabled, listens on
   your own machine (127.0.0.1 by default) and is not exposed elsewhere unless you
   configure it to be.

